                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Minh Anh has spent eighteen years building cross-border trade programmes across Southeast Asia and now leads one of Vietnam's largest industry alliances, representing more than 400 member companies.",
