                  "name": "Bio Paragraph",
                  "fill": "$ink-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Before taking the role of Chief Executive Officer in 2021, Minh Anh spent a decade in public policy, advising the Ministry of Industry and Trade on export competitiveness and regional integration frameworks.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "BKYEf",
                  "name": "Bio Paragraph",
                  "fill": "$ink-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Her current focus is on helping mid-sized manufacturers adopt digital supply-chain tooling without disrupting existing operations — a theme she will unpack in the opening keynote on 15 December.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.75,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
